sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Player
    participant A as SpireSight
    participant R as Run State
    participant K as Card index
    participant M as Vision model
    Note over P,M: Before the reward · Inspect the deck
    P->>A: Capture deck screens
    A->>M: Screens + JSON extraction prompt
    M-->>A: Cards, relics and deck assessment
    A->>R: Validate and save
    Note over P,M: At the reward screen · Which card fits?
    P->>A: Ask for a card recommendation
    opt Saved deck available
        A->>R: Read latest inspection
        R-->>A: Deck context, including Bash
    end
    opt Local lookup enabled and index available
        A->>K: Search question text
        K-->>A: Card facts on a match
    end
    A->>M: Strategy prompt + context + reward screenshot + question
    loop As the answer arrives
        M-->>A: Text fragment
        A-->>P: Append to chat
    end
